e":"汐宮 ルシア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A nun girl from the historic church in Gojou town. She will often wander around town in monastic clothing. Because of her kind personality, she is very well liked in town. Because of her compassion, she cooked for the starving protagonist. Since then, the protagonist refused to leave the church, but she did not mind instead welcomed his arrival."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21775"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"五条町に古くからある教会で、シスターをしている女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よく修道服のまま町をうろついている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"温厚で心優しい性格のため、町のみんなから好かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"空腹で命を落としかけていた薫に、慈悲の心でご飯を作ってあげた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以来、教会に薫が居座ってしまうことになるが、嫌な顔ひとつせず歓迎している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"暴れ馬のような母親・ゆり子を、唯一乗りこなせる人物でもある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1951","sourceWorkId":"16611","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"五条町に古くからある教会で、シスターをしている女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よく修道服のまま町をうろついている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"温厚で心優しい性格のため、町のみんなから好かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"空腹で命を落としかけていた薫に、慈悲の心でご飯を作ってあげた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以来、協会に薫が居座ってしまうことになるが、嫌な顔ひとつせず歓迎している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"暴れ馬のような母親・ゆり子を、唯一乗りこなせる人物でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「困ったことがありましたら、いつでもお越しください。教会とは、そういうものです」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22470"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c22dcead57b59e4923c7ed635dc159629ee9426e937d505432a3375fdb814b9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/996d0b7d078515104a7a44d925a52d0eb15ec45bf521a3d422f94eea0036e2fe.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水橋かおり","creatorId":"vndb:s131","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s131","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s131","name":"水橋 かおり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:29466:22470:3851:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21776","characterName":"冬月 小菜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22473","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"29466"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1954"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21776"},"originalCharacterName":"冬月 小菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shigure's elder twin sister. While their hairstyles are different, their face and body are identical. Her personality is the exact opposite of Shigure, she is very close to others and very optimistic. She is a girl with a natural bright smile. One of her charm is that she loves to tease others but never mean any harm. She is always worried about her antisocial sister."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21776"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"時雨の双子の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"髪型は違うが、顔や体つきまでそっくり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし時雨とは反対で、人懐っこく常に楽天的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天然の明るさと笑顔のある少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人をからかうことが好きな一面もあり、自由な言動も多いが、嫌味な感じではなく、そんな部分も彼女の魅力の一つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"社交性のあまりない妹のことを常に気にかけている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1954","sourceWorkId":"16611","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"時雨の双子の姉。 髪型は違うが、顔や身体つきまでそっくり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし時雨とは反対で、人懐っこく常に楽天的。 天然の明るさと笑顔のある少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人をからかうことが好きな一面もあり自由な言動も多いが、嫌味な感じではなく、そんな部分も彼女の魅力の一つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"社交性があまりない妹のことを常に気に掛けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「薫さんも意外とお子様ですよねー。 ふふふ。可愛いです。 私の弟になってもいいですよ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22473"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ea/eaeec59b37a0bf1df7dd413604874a7398ab5661a9a80d0836f41365ef54fa7a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ea/eac5637fecfbe1cbc439ed85b6f06ee8f306144cc96f62c21f587abea0884f1c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"後藤麻衣","creatorId":"vndb:s469","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s469","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s469","name":"後藤 麻衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:29466:22473:4809:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21777","characterName":"冬月 時雨","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22472","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"29466"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1953"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21777"},"originalCharacterName":"冬月 時雨","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kona's younger twin sister. Likes sticking to her sister, and has always been together. Carelessly and hates trivial thing, she has distinct likes and dislikes. She won't hesitate to speak, but she also has a shy side. She is also childishly violent, and will sometimes hit the protagonist. She got acquainted with the protagonist after she rescued him when he collapsed in the church."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21777"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ルシアと同じ学園に通っている少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"双子姉妹の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お姉ちゃん大好きっ子で、幼いころからいつも一緒だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大ざっぱで細かいことが苦手。好き嫌いがはっきり出てしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物事ははっきり言うタイプだが、人見知りな部分もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、暴力的な部分もあり、主人公の薫に食って掛かることもしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"薫とは、教会の中で倒れてしまった時、助られたことで知り合う。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1953","sourceWorkId":"16611","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ルシアと同じ学園に通っている少女。 双子姉妹の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お姉ちゃん大好きっ子で、幼い頃からいつも一緒だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大ざっぱで細かいことが苦手。 好き嫌いがハッキリ出てしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物事はハッキリ言うタイプだが、人見知りな部分もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また暴力的な部分もあり、主人公の薫に食って掛かることもしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"薫とは、教会の中で倒れてしまった時に助けられたことで知り合う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「なんでアンタがあたしの部屋に勝手に入ってるのよっ！　ぶっとばすわよ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22472"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2c82c05d0807db999e3734b8ead0dfeaa93c20f76d34078c4e717b4386a32a4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c52b2de70db824e41f8df22eedbbf279b22255b9ffdf5414d4262d7e157b504c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中美幸","creatorId":"vndb:s3698","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3698","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3698","name":"田中 美幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:29466:22472:17076:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21778","characterName":"九条 乙女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22471","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"29466"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1952"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21778"},"originalCharacterName":"九条 乙女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kujou family's second daughter. She is the protagonist's cousin and they have a marriage promise. Very much loves the protagonist, one day she suddenly started traveling to look for him, and finally found him at Gojou town. She is an ojou-sama from a family with famous history, but she isn't interested in that, the only thing that is in her eyes is the protagonist. But despite that, she is good at ojou-sama activities like tea ceremony, flower arrangement and cooking."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21778"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"九条本家の次女で、薫の従妹にあたる少女。薫の許嫁でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"薫のことが大好きで、ある日突然、旅に出てしまった薫を追いかけ、各地を探し回り、五条町で再会をすることになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仮にも歴史ある家のお嬢様なのだが、ネジが外れたかのようなハイテンションで騒がしくいつも薫にまとわりついている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、お嬢様らしく茶道や華道、料理等が得意な面もある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1952","sourceWorkId":"16611","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"九条本家の次女で、薫の従妹にあたる少女。 薫の許嫁でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"薫のことが大好きで、ある日突然 旅に出てしまった薫を追い掛け各地を探し回り、五条町で再会することになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仮にも歴史ある家のお嬢様なのだが、ネジが外れたかのようなハイテンションで騒がしく、いつも薫にまとわりついている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、お嬢様らしく茶道や華道、料理などが得意な面もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「誰が子供ですのっ！　わたくし九条乙女はどこからどう見ても大人のレディですわっ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22471"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd9a23aa89669084950b50a3ad349775d39710346a3a0fa376d927ad19216429.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23b7b1e22991ccbaf34a2737a27db1e064a8f1fc53fd21b6e2429f86f56a7957.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柏木美優","creatorId":"vndb:s1030","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1030","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1030","name":"柏木 美優","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:29466:22471:6540:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c168316","characterName":"汐 宮 ノエル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c168316"},"originalCharacterName":"汐 宮 ノエル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lucia’s older sister,"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"who had been possessed by the demon Astaroth since before her birth, Yuriko was originally possessed by this demon, but he moved to her daughter’s body while she was still in her womb."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"The girl exhibited abnormal behavior from a very early age, In addition to not fully realizing she had been possessed by something like a demon, she hated listening to and reading the Bible, and little by little the demon took more control of her until she ended up killing her father and escaping."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After her escape, she was taken into the care of an orphanage until she returned and met Lucia again during the events of her route."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She died shortly after Astaroth was exorcize from her body since was the contract with him that keep her alive until that moment"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c168316"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75e137ec38adea7f81a93d7923f74efba1fe1bcb1c2cd19aa55704ec4b4548e5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/15372087c64c258a6fd6dd9e0d0e03bf7bd2ba9dd9f312c49d5344dfbe3c16af.webp","width":246,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41325","characterName":"九条 薫","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41325"},"originalCharacterName":"九条 薫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d0140ad6c76165b0d0f5633961cbdd1ad28d94d